  "recommendedNextStep": "For Scenario A, record the correction with the rejected assumption (authoring backend in scope), new invariant (authoring backend out of scope), affected surfaces (blog UI implementation), and smallest disconfirming next probe. For Scenario B, proceed with the DeepSeek reevaluation as a new task without a correction receipt. For Scenario C, continue the reevaluation without ceremony and without creating a receipt."
}

